msgid ""
"By signing up on our site you agree to our terms and conditions [link]. "
"We'll create a new user account for you based on your submissions. All data "
"you submit will be stored on our servers.After your registration we'll "
"instantly send you an email with an activation link to verify your mail "
"address. "
